# Deploy

Production activation builds on the native builder and `nix copy`s the
closure with `deploy-rs`, then `switch-to-configuration`. `x86_64-linux`
builds on `proxmox-dev`. `aarch64-linux` builds on `rpi4`. Hosts
substitute from `cache.nixos.org`. Facts, make targets, CI vs local, and
the script index: `docs/deployments.md`.

## Where it runs

Edits land on the Darwin checkout. **x86_64 deploys run on
`root@proxmox-dev`.** aarch64 runs on `root@rpi4` via
`scripts/run-on-rpi4.sh` (`make deploy-rpi`).

Do not `make deploy` from the laptop store or from `gaming`. Do not
qemu-compile `rpi4` on `proxmox-dev`. `deploy-host.sh rpi4` from
proxmox-dev exits.

`proxmox-dev` has no deploy identity. Hop to targets with the operator
agent: `ssh -A root@proxmox-dev`. Plain `ssh` cannot `nix copy` or switch
remote hosts. Heredoc: `docs/deployments.md`.

`gaming` is a production deploy target (`make deploy-gaming`). `make
reboot-all` skips it. Do not set Nix `extra-platforms` to qemu-build
`rpi4` on `proxmox-dev` (Exec format error). GitLab does not deploy
(`docs/adr/2026-11-05-ci-lint-only.md`).

Do not activate `proxmox-applications-1` or `proxmox-applications-2`.
They are `fleet.inventory.deployPausedHosts`.

## Scope

Docs-only: no deploy. Garage changes: `proxmox-observability`
(`docs/services/garage.md`). Mimir / ntfy / Prometheus / Grafana:
`proxmox-observability` only. Edge Caddy / Keycloak `/admin` CIDR:
`xcloud-caddy`. Do not `make deploy` the fleet for one service.

## After switch

`restartIfChanged = false` on Mimir, Grafana, Loki, ntfy, and similar. A
successful switch can leave the old process on the old config. Restart the
unit you changed and read the journal for `error parsing config` / exit 1
before calling it done.

Invalid Mimir YAML keys (`bucket_lookup_type = "path-style"`,
`compactor.partial_block_deletion_delay`) crash-loop the daemon. Valid forms
are `path` and `limits.compactor_partial_block_deletion_delay`.

`nixos-rebuild --rollback` fails (`nixos-config` is not on `NIX_PATH`). Use
`/nix/var/nix/profiles/system-N-link/bin/switch-to-configuration switch`
(`docs/runbooks/rollback.md`). `deploy-rs` `magicRollback` reverts a
failed confirmation on the production path.

## Operator copy (x86)

```bash
rsync -az --delete --exclude='.git/' --exclude='result' --exclude='.direnv/' \
  /Users/alex/code/nixos-fleet/ root@proxmox-dev:/root/nixos-fleet-deploy/
```

On proxmox-dev, `./scripts/deploy-host.sh <host>`. Open that session with
`ssh -A`. rpi4: `./scripts/run-on-rpi4.sh ./scripts/deploy-host.sh rpi4`.
Full heredoc: `docs/deployments.md`. The script passes `cache.nixos.org`
on the CLI so the first switch works while `nix.conf` still names Attic.
